Future source code and runnable implementations are licensed under Apache License 2.0 unless a specific third-party notice states otherwise. Full text: LICENSE-CODE. No implementation is included in the initial scaffold.

Contributors retain copyright in their contributions. Inbound contributions use the applicable outbound license. Third-party materials retain their own notices and licenses.

No rights to upstream names, logos, trademarks or visual identity are granted. No upstream brand assets are included.
